      "page_id": "n_aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaadpga",
      "sections": [
        {
          "body": "\nThe wiki of a vault stores readable pages as place nodes: a page, its sections in order and the notes on them. Pages link to each other by id, for example [the item types](hive:n_aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaadpgb#types-and-bodies).\n\nW58 and its `wiki_pages` table are gone since C0 2.2. Pages export as Markdown, one file per page or a zip per vault.\n\n",
